.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/contractautomataproject/CIF3Connector/raw/cba8c0b34ea88c18fda2fd6844e3c818feda8df6/README.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/contractautomataproject/CIF3Connector/contents/README.md?ref=cba8c0b34ea88c18fda2fd6844e3c818feda8df6", "patch": "@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ The tool is provided as a JAR package and can be executed from the command line.\n \n ### Basic Command Syntax\n ```bash\n-java -jar CIF3Connector.jar -i <input1.data> [<input2.data> ...] [-o <composition.cif> <orchestration.cif>]\n+java -jar CIF3Connector.jar -i <input1.data> [<input2.data> ...] [-o <composition.cif> <orchestration.cif>] [-a]\n ```\n \n ### Parameters\n@@ -30,13 +30,13 @@ java -jar CIF3Connector.jar -i <input1.data> [<input2.data> ...] [-o <compositio\n 1. **Multiple Input Files:**\n    To compose a dealer and a player automaton and specify custom output names:\n    ```bash\n-   java -jar CIF3Connector-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar -i Dealer.data Player.data -o MyComp.cif MyOrch.cif\n+   java -jar CIF3Connector.jar -i Dealer.data Player.data -o MyComp.cif MyOrch.cif\n    ```\n \n 2. **Single Input File:**\n    If a single automaton is provided, it is treated as a pre-composed automaton. The tool will apply the most permissive controller synthesis before translating it to CIF3:\n    ```bash\n-   java -jar CIF3Connector-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar -i CardComposition.data\n+   java -jar CIF3Connector.jar -i CardComposition.data\n    ```\n \n ## Workflow Overview"}, {"sha": "286fee802548edf34441144b72a563e7b9645066", "filename": "dependency-reduced-pom.xml", "status": "modified", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2, "changes": 4, "blob_url": "https://github.com/contractautomataproject/CIF3Connector/blob/cba8c0b34ea88c18fda2fd6844e3c818feda8df6/dependency-reduced-pom.xml", "raw_url": "https://github.com/contractautomataproject/CIF3Connector/raw/cba8c0b34ea88c18fda2fd6844e3c818feda8df6/dependency-reduced-pom.xml", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/contractautomatapro